; Foundation bed along the house wall, under the window.
[sub_resource type="BoxMesh" id="Mesh_bed_house"]
size = Vector3(6.4, 0.04, 1.1)

; Two beds out in the lawn. The foundation bed against the wall only shows when
; the player leans into the glass: from a standing eye the sill hides the ground
; until about z -4.0, and that bed sits at -3.6..-2.5. These are past that line,
